	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Lists the projects you recently opened in Bambu Studio, newest first, with thumbnails.

Type the keyword (default `bambu`) and keep typing to filter by file name or folder.

## Actions

- **↵** Open in Bambu Studio
- **⌘↵** Reveal in Finder
- **⌥↵** Copy path to clipboard
- **⇧** Quick Look

Projects on a volume that isn't mounted stay in the list; only **⌥↵** works for them.

## Configuration

Change the keyword in the workflow's **Configure Workflow** panel.

## Contributing

Source code, issues and pull requests are on GitHub: [skydiver/alfred-bambu-studio](https://github.com/skydiver/alfred-bambu-studio). Bug reports, ideas and contributions are welcome.</string>
